{"title":"Homework without the fight","speaker":"Jordan","business":"Bright Path Tutoring","voice":"slt","note":"Sample talk for the Video studio. Fictional speaker and business. Timings match ffmpeg flite voice slt.","duration":140.27,"sentences":[{"t":"Hi, I'm Jordan, and I run Bright Path Tutoring here in Columbus.","s":0.35,"e":4.71,"section":0},{"t":"Every week a parent tells me the same thing.","s":4.99,"e":7.88,"section":0},{"t":"Homework turns into a fight, every single night.","s":8.16,"e":11.24,"section":0},{"t":"So today I want to give you what I actually do with families.","s":11.52,"e":15.14,"section":0},{"t":"No fancy program. Just what works at the kitchen table.","s":15.42,"e":19.64,"section":0},{"t":"Here's the first one.","s":20.39,"e":21.91,"section":1},{"t":"The first five minutes decide the whole night.","s":22.19,"e":24.87,"section":1},{"t":"If your kid sits down and the first problem is the hardest one, you've lost them.","s":25.15,"e":29.67,"section":1},{"t":"So start with something they can win.","s":29.95,"e":32.26,"section":1},{"t":"One easy problem. One word they know. Then the hard stuff.","s":32.54,"e":36.36,"section":1},{"t":"A quick win gets them moving, and moving is half the battle.","s":36.64,"e":40.31,"section":1},{"t":"Number two is something parents say all the time.","s":41.06,"e":44.11,"section":2},{"t":"I was bad at math too.","s":44.39,"e":46.08,"section":2},{"t":"I get why you say it. You're trying to make them feel better.","s":46.36,"e":50.07,"section":2},{"t":"But what your kid hears is, people like us don't do math.","s":50.35,"e":53.75,"section":2},{"t":"So drop that line, and say this instead.","s":54.03,"e":57.05,"section":2},{"t":"This part is hard, and you can do hard things.","s":57.33,"e":60.14,"section":2},{"t":"Number three will save you a lot of evenings.","s":60.89,"e":63.35,"section":3},{"t":"Don't check the whole page at the end.","s":63.63,"e":65.75,"section":3},{"t":"Check the first two answers.","s":66.03,"e":68.16,"section":3},{"t":"If those two are right, walk away and let them finish.","s":68.44,"e":71.56,"section":3},{"t":"If they're wrong, you caught it before they practiced the mistake twenty times.","s":71.84,"e":76.13,"section":3},{"t":"Now, reading.","s":76.88,"e":78.23,"section":4},{"t":"Twenty minutes a day, out loud, and your kid picks the book.","s":78.51,"e":82.24,"section":4},{"t":"Comics count. Recipes count. The back of the cereal box counts.","s":82.52,"e":86.92,"section":4},{"t":"The goal isn't the book. The goal is a kid who doesn't hate reading.","s":87.2,"e":90.71,"section":4},{"t":"Once that changes, everything else in school gets easier.","s":90.99,"e":94.61,"section":4},{"t":"Parents ask me what happens on a first call.","s":95.36,"e":98.34,"section":5},{"t":"I ask one question before anything else.","s":98.62,"e":101.34,"section":5},{"t":"What does your kid say about school when nobody's asking?","s":101.62,"e":105.12,"section":5},{"t":"That answer tells me more than a report card.","s":105.4,"e":108.41,"section":5},{"t":"Bored is different from lost, and lost is different from scared.","s":108.69,"e":112.65,"section":5},{"t":"And each one needs a different plan.","s":112.93,"e":115.07,"section":5},{"t":"If any of this sounds like your house, here's what I'd do.","s":115.82,"e":119.58,"section":6},{"t":"Book a free twenty minute reading check.","s":119.86,"e":122.29,"section":6},{"t":"I'll sit with your kid, find where reading gets stuck, and give you a plan you can use at home.","s":122.57,"e":128.16,"section":6},{"t":"There's no pressure to sign up for anything.","s":128.44,"e":131.48,"section":6},{"t":"The link is in my bio, or send me the word READ.","s":131.76,"e":135.03,"section":6},{"t":"Thanks for watching, and good luck tonight at the kitchen table.","s":135.31,"e":139.12,"section":6}],"words":[["Hi,",0.54,0.81],["I'm",0.93,1.07],["Jordan,",1.07,1.54],["and",1.66,2],["I",2,2.07],["run",2.07,2.37],["Bright",2.37,2.61],["Path",2.61,